      "message": "By this CL, the delay will be the time interval between the current time and SCTS. However,\n\nwriteIncomingSmsSessionWithType(..., timestamps[], ...) {\n    offset \u003d timestamps[0] - SystemClock.elapsedRealtime();\n    FOR(i) {\n        smsSession.addEvent(timestamps[i] - offset, ...);\n    }\n}\nNamely,\nIf A \u003d SystemClock.elapsedRealtime();\n1st part or single SMS \u003d\u003e smsSession.addEvent(A, ...); \u003d\u003e Maybe, the delay will be 1 always.\n\n2nd part \u003d\u003e smsSession.addEvent(A + interval between 1st and 2nd part , ...);\n..\ni-th part \u003d\u003e smsSession.addEvent(A + interval between 1st and i-th part , ...);\n\nAre they expected result?",
